      "id": "claim_3fd400b43a02410d8ace9184b9c5f489",
      "statement": "CacheManager's static default instance is installed by the synchronized setCacheDir(String[, EnvironmentProvider]) overloads (creating the directory, defaulting to \"cache\" when the argument is null, and reading configuration from a new SystemEnvironment in the one-argument form); getDefaultInstance() throws IllegalStateException (\"Cache directory not set\") until then, and the package-private resetDefaultInstance() flushes the default instance if one exists and clears it (test-only, requiring setCacheDir again afterwards).",
