    {
      "id": "claim_97d2dc510bff49cd86a898a272ae1fcb",
      "statement": "Each CacheManager holds the EnvironmentProvider it was created with and reads its configuration from it at construction time: CACHE_HIERARCHY (default LOCAL, comma-separated CacheType values, primary first; quotes stripped, entries trimmed, case-insensitive mapping, empty entries and unknown values throwing IllegalArgumentException) and CACHE_REPLACEMENT_STRATEGY (default NONE, one of NONE/ERROR/OVERWRITE, invalid values throwing with the valid options); the parsed values are kept in final fields and never re-read.",
