      "id": "claim_61664797f5d44eeaafa1c32b58f68218",
      "statement": "Redis connection settings are read when a cache is first requested, not at CacheManager construction: buildCacheHierarchy instantiates the backends inside getCache, where the Redis-based constructors read REDIS_URL (or REST_REDIS_URI/credentials) from the manager's environment and connect with fail-fast PING semantics; CacheManagerTest.passesEnvironmentToRedisCache pins this by asserting the JedisConnectionException names the REDIS_URL injected at construction.",
