    {
      "id": "claim_05080dac849d4eef93e0e9f7c687d1a2",
      "statement": "getCache(Object origin, CacheParameter<K>) rejects null origin or parameters with IllegalArgumentException, derives the cache name as origin.getClass().getSimpleName() + \"_\" + parameters.parameters(), replaces every colon with a double underscore before use as a file name, memoizes the resulting cache by name within the manager, and throws IllegalArgumentException (\"Cache with name … already exists with different parameters\") when the same name is requested with CacheParameter objects that are not equals — a conflict detected on parameter equality, so identity-distinct parameters sharing one identifier still collide.",
