    {
      "id": "claim_3b6b0bb4fad1461cb7de69d381ba778d",
      "statement": "HierarchicalCache<K> implements Cache<K> by composing a primaryCache and secondaryCache plus a CacheReplacementStrategy (all null-checked): every put variant writes through to the primary and then the secondary layer, get/getViaInternalKey read both layers and delegate resolution to the strategy (which backfills the missing layer), containsKey is true when either layer holds the key, flush flushes both layers, and the read/write methods are synchronized on the instance.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/edu/kit/kastel/mcse/ardoco/llm/cache/HierarchicalCache.java#L54-L100",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3b066c20e51c7fdb6eae03145fc60c725ea9d051902176d3e03fd2386f588e0f:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f835045e6bfc4420a08a6b151a23ec66",
      "statement": "CacheReplacementStrategy treats a conflict as exactly the case where both layers hold non-null values for the key that are not Objects.deepEquals-equal (so structurally equal values such as deserialized arrays count as agreement); the base resolve backfills in either direction — writing the secondary value into the primary when the primary is null and the primary value into the secondary when the secondary is null, returning the present value in both cases — and otherwise returns the primary value; ERROR overrides only the conflict case to log and throw IllegalStateException, and OVERWRITE overrides only the conflict case to write the primary value into the secondary cache and return it; backfill is shared by all strategies through delegation, and the deprecated resolveViaInternalKey path mirrors all of this via putViaInternalKey/getViaInternalKey.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/edu/kit/kastel/mcse/ardoco/llm/cache/CacheReplacementStrategy.java#L113-L154",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:fc300393c8e16b97fe881c90a16a86b491cf7020ed48d04c5293256916eaa2cd:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/edu/kit/kastel/mcse/ardoco/llm/cache/CacheReplacementStrategy.java#L31-L92",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:c908b7288c0806d11df2310a501ce1788300d0ef2f50dc624cc6b84d842e4dde:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/test/java/edu/kit/kastel/mcse/ardoco/llm/cache/CacheReplacementStrategyTest.java#L131-L160",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:571bd1b308d0bd55a6acb8c535d57c101a6eefee3952f4b1aa3dee4e84c1b0ff:"
        }
      ]
    },
