      "id": "claim_a75a447b375e4ec29d5181a7b15ebee8",
      "statement": "Model code obtains caches from CacheManager in two ways: CachedEmbeddingCreator fetches its embedding cache itself in its constructor via cacheManager.getCache(this, embeddingCacheParameter), with EmbeddingCreator.create(configuration) wiring the default instance (create(configuration, cacheManager) accepting an explicit one and MOCK needing none); on the chat side the cache is injected — CachingChatModel and ChatModelUtils.cachedRequest/nCachedRequest take the Cache<ChatCacheKey> as an argument, and callers combine ChatModelProvider.cacheParameters() (model name, seed, temperature) with the manager, flushing after each newly computed response in CachingChatModel's case.",
