      "id": "claim_2a4c1e0d252a4ba6ba7435f6607ba99c",
      "statement": "CacheManager.flush() flushes every cache the manager has memoized, cascading through each HierarchicalCache into every layer; the documented replication-package workflow relies on calling CacheManager.getDefaultInstance().flush() after an experiment against a shared Redis layer so the co-layered LOCAL directory holds every entry the run touched before it is shipped.",
